Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.45,0:00:17.41,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That person... {HA: She is...}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.62,0:00:19.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She's crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.60,0:00:24.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:18.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Summer break ends too quickly.{The summer break ends too quickly.}{too true... even if I do have 3 months of break...} {HA: Summer break didn't last long enough...}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.85,0:02:22.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do? I haven't even finished my homework yet. {HA: What should i do? I haven't even finished my homework yet.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:23.83,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,, Me neither.{Me too.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.25,0:02:34.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There is someone, right? Someone you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:40.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The one Akihime likes... is Kisaragi-sensei?{The person Akihime likes... is Kisaragi-sensei?}{HA: The one Akihime likes... is Kisaragi-sensei?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.20,0:02:50.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For what reason... am I hiding? {HA: Why am I hiding?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.94,0:02:53.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Good morning, Tsuwabuki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.75,0:02:58.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.40,0:03:01.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, right. May I have a bit of your time?{Right Right, May I have a bit of your time?}{any English equivalent of “sho sho” ?} {HA: my best guess is: Right then,}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.65,0:03:02.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes? {HA: ...Yes?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.85,0:03:11.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss.{My lady.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.95,0:03:14.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I have brought Tsuwabuki-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.30,0:03:17.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Matsuda, you may go now.{somthing I can't make out that second word} {HA: You may go?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.00,0:03:19.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Miss. {HA: Do we need the La la la...?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.25,0:03:25.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Umm, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.50,0:03:30.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,About that incident... You didn't tell anyone, right? {HA: About that incident. You didn't tell anyone, did you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.45,0:03:32.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? What incident? {HA: What incident?}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.69,0:03:35.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The incident at camp!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.30,0:03:38.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,At camp? Oh, you mean when I carried you during the courage...{Oh, the piggy back ride during courage test-}{piggy back ride sounds weird} {HA: Camp? OH! When i carried you during the courage test--} {At camp? Oh, the time when I carried you during the courage test... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.50,0:03:39.53,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Not so loud!{You're too loud!/You're talking to loudly!/Your voice is to high/loud!} {HA: SHE SAID ALL THAT? lol jk HA: Not so loud!}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.03,0:03:48.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I won't tell anyone, I promise. {I won't tell anyone, I promise. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.60,0:03:51.12,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And this conversation too. Don't tell anyone. {\check}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.91,0:03:53.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Matsuda, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.79,0:03:55.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, Miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.75,0:03:58.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse us. {HA: Excuse us.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.25,0:04:30.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}No matter who Akihime likes, it's none of my business.{I have no business with that./It does not matter for me.}{HA: It is none of my business who Akihime likes. No matter who it is.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.71,0:04:36.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Though that's what I thought... {HA: This line doesnt fit.} {Though, that's what I thought... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.95,0:04:39.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Then why...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.45,0:05:01.61,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, don't push yourself too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.61,0:05:04.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's good to rest when you need to.{It is good to rest when you’re suppose to rest.}{HA: It's good to rest when you need to./you're supposed to.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.10,0:05:09.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Nako-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What happened? {HA: What's wrong?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:15.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yaeno-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.10,0:05:21.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, the shop wasn't open today and I came to help, but...{Sorry, the shop didn’t open today so I came to help but...} {\check}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.30,0:05:23.67,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.65,0:05:29.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nothing's wrong. But thank you. {\for caring}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.75,0:05:35.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Haru! {HA: I still don't know what this word is.} {Tsuwabuki Masa(haru), was it? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.94,0:05:41.23,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,There was nothing to do, so... {HA: There was nothing to do, so...}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.23,0:05:44.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,While bringing food I came to help on something. {\check} {HA: Reccomend a moving /clip do cover up subs?} {HA: I bring food and wish to help with something.} {I want to help on something while I brought food. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.70,0:05:54.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You know that you can eat sunflower seeds, right? {HA: You know that you can eat sunflower seeds, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:59.29,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Since it should taste better than the ones we sell, I thought of trying one. {\check} {HA: Since it should taste better than the ones we sell, I think I'm gonna try one.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.56,0:06:02.54,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Was it okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:07.09,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Actually, it tasted horrible. It was really bitter. {no clue} {It tasted horrible. It was really bitter. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.95,0:06:11.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Noboku-san told me this:{Nobuko-san said this before.} {HA: Nobuko-san told me this:}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.55,0:06:13.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"That T-shirt doesn't suit you."{That the T-shirt don’t suite you.}{HA: "That T-shirt doesn't suit you."}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:16.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"If it were summer, it would suit you better."{When it is about a man of summer, Matsuda who has soft/light skin suite better.}{\check} {HA: "If it were summer, it would suit you better."} {If it was summer, it would suit you better. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.50,0:06:17.98,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So I said this:{:}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.98,0:06:22.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay for someone who is weak and without muscles to wear it in summer, right?{It is ok to have man of summer who is weak and without muscles isn’t it?}{HA: ...what?} {HA: "Should a man who is weak and doesnt have muscles be wearing it?" ? lol i dunno} {Is it alright for a a weak and thin-looking man to wear it? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.20,0:06:24.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime-san, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.65,0:06:34.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I could talk like that, I would… {HA: If I could talk like that, I would...}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.15,0:06:37.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki, that's not a weed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Eh? Ah, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.67,0:06:43.79,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I... think I should go home for today.{I... should go home now today.}{HA: I... think i should go home./think i'll go home now.} {I.. think I should go home for today. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:58.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right! When I'm Yuki-chan, I can talk more about certain things.{Okay! If it is Yuki-chan I can talked much about this and that.}{HA: Alright! When I'm Yuki-chan, I can talk more about this and that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.40,0:07:03.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’m so pitiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.00,0:07:11.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome, Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.15,0:07:14.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is... an acorn? {HA: This is... an acorn?}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.58,0:07:18.33,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was on the ground at the greenhouse. {HA: It was on the ground at the greenhouse.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.33,0:07:21.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It was all alone stuck on the ground, so...{It was just plop on the ground alone so.}{HA: It was alone, just plop on the ground, so...} {plop?}{It was all alone, stuck on the ground, so... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.95,0:07:24.71,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It looked like a stray. {\check} {HA: I guess it was a stray... (?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.71,0:07:28.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A stray? Sumomo thinks of interesting things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.75,0:07:31.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Normally, looking at an acorn you wouldn't think of it like that.{Normally after looking at an acorn you wouldn't think like that.} {\check} {HA: Normally you wouldn't think that of an acorn.}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.84,0:07:36.39,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.07,0:07:43.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Ore, err... I'll listen to you if there's anything you want to tell me. You might even feel refreshed after doing so.{If it is ok to tell someone like I-me, I'll listen. You might even feel refreshed after you say it.} {\when Yuki/Tsuwabuki addressed himself, he first used Ore, but quickly changed to Boku, which are two difference ways of addressing oneself} {HA: in an earlier episode, Sumomo corrected him and told him to use Boku, not Ore} {HA: If it's allright to tell me, I'll listen. You might even feel better afterwards!} {If there's something you want to share with I.. me, then I'll listen. You might feel better afterwards!- megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.55,0:07:47.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you Yuki-chan, you're so kind. {HA: Thank you, Yuki-chan, you're kind.} {Thank you, Yuki-chan. You're so kind. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.95,0:07:50.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,When I saw this, I remembered...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.80,0:07:54.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,During the entrance ceremony a year ago in spring... {HA: A year ago, the entrance ceremony in the spring...}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.10,0:07:59.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In the cherry blossom forest behind the school,{In the cherry forest behind the school.}{HA: should we capitalize Cherry Forest? *shrugs*} {It's okay as it is. I think it's actually referring to the "forest of sakura\cherry blossoms". - megu} {In the cherry blossom forest, behind the school. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.62,0:08:02.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I got lost.{I got lost.}{HA: I... lost track of where i was.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.30,0:08:05.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I had gotten separated from Nako-chan.{Being separated from Nako-chan.}{HA: I was separated from Nako-chan.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.30,0:08:12.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You had gotten lost during... the entrance ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.10,0:08:18.22,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Could it be...?{Maybe./Could it be./Possibly} {HA: Could it be...}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:23.48,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I... was nervous and scared. {HA: I... was nervous... and scared.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.48,0:08:25.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was about to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.36,0:08:27.69,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.32,0:08:35.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I met this boy...{I met a boy/guy/man}{HA: I met this boy...}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.70,0:08:39.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The girl from back then was... Sumomo? {HA: The girl from then was... Sumomo?} {The girl from back then was... Sumomo? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.45,0:08:47.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,He was also a new student, and he even took me all the way back to the entrance ceremony. {He was also a new student, and he even took me all the way back to the entrance ceremony. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.40,0:08:50.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was… very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.15,0:08:54.43,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, about that person, do you... {\like him?}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.97,0:08:56.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.{Yea/Yes/Yep.} {HA: Yes.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.30,0:09:02.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, it may be that my first love won't come true.{But it maybe true that first love won't come true} {\really don't want to put true twice, but I couldn't think of anything else} {HA: But, it may be that my first love won't come true.}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:07.31,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because that person already has someone that they like...{Because that person has someone who they like…}{Because that person already likes someone... - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.35,0:09:09.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.65,0:09:12.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The ring!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.40,0:09:22.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What?! {HA: What?!}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.83,0:09:28.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This place was a waterway for children. Earlier... {HA: Earlier...}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.60,0:09:32.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Because the star drop went in, it became like this? {Combining the "star" and "drop" into one word. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.80,0:09:36.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The star drop!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.60,0:09:38.26,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, are you okay?{Are you ok?}{HA: Are you allright? Sumomo?} {Sumomo, are you alright? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.97,0:09:40.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll give it a try...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.15,0:09:46.52,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Ruche Puria...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.10,0:09:50.57,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Still weak against water, I see. {HA: , I see...}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.69,0:09:56.36,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And you still call yourself a Stellar Spinear? {HA: Stellaspinia?}{Stellar Spinier? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.60,0:09:57.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aspalas-san?{Aspara-san.} {? (?)}
