Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.45,0:10:02.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Say it right!{Say it correctly!} {HA: Say it right!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.33,0:10:07.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Whatever. In order to see who the superior Stellar Spinear is, this a battle. {HA: Whatever. To see who is the superior Stellaspinia, let's battle.} {Whatever. Let's battle to see who is the superior Stellar Spinier. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.50,0:10:10.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But… A battle? {HA: But... A battle...?}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.40,0:10:11.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Enough talk!{No more needless talk!/No talking back!}{\check} {HA: No back-talk! (?)} {Enough talk! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.40,0:10:15.30,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Beam Cometi Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:23.35,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Ara Deum Mei!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.60,0:10:28.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.70,0:10:31.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try my very best!{I’ll try my best as far as I can.}{HA: I'll try the very best that I can!}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.70,0:10:32.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:34.90,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Beam Cometi Aqua!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.45,0:10:59.68,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Somehow you made it. {\check}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.85,0:11:02.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s a full on fair and square battle! {It's a fair and square battle! - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.90,0:11:14.94,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo! Sumomo!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.30,0:11:28.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.70,0:11:34.45,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.80,0:11:37.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It's fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.90,0:11:40.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss please be careful, that star drop is no push over.{/That star drop is not feeble./That star drop is capable}{HA: My lady, please be careful. This one won't be easy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:43.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just as I expected.{It is as I wished.}{HA: Just as I hoped.}{expected. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.30,0:11:46.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It should be this difficult for it to be worthwhile.{It should be this much at least for it to be worthy.}{the battle, difficult what not} {HA: For it to be worth it, it should be this hard.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.50,0:11:48.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo, are you okay? {HA: are you alright?}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:51.77,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If I make a mistake, I quickly cry. {HA: If I make a mistake, I will quickly cry.} {The original's fine. Sumomo's a natural crybaby, so... - megu}
