Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.00,0:12:05.87,Sumomo[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Moterios Oludin Radium!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.75,0:12:22.42,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.15,0:12:44.28,Prima Aspalas[Spell],,0000,0000,0000,,Puruvi Radius!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.50,0:12:55.62,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Spectacular! Miss is the complete victor! {HA: Spectacular! My lady is the complete victor!}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.62,0:12:56.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, Miss?{My lady?}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.96,0:12:59.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What was that… that previous technique?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.80,0:13:02.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The Recipe that even I, the best in Saint Aspalas, don’t know… {HA: A recipe that even I, the best in Cent Asparas don't know...}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.65,0:13:05.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}How can this girl… {HA: How can this girl...}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.40,0:13:11.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,P-Please wait Miss! Miss!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo! Sumomo, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.90,0:13:18.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki-chan, I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.75,0:13:22.86,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,After all that, the star drop... I lost it.{In the end the star drop was taken away.}{HA: After all that, the star drop... I lost it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.15,0:13:25.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,E-Everybody fails from time to time. {No matter who it is, there is a time when they fail.}{HA: E-Everyone fails from time to time.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:27.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You just need to try harder again next time.{Just need to try again next time./Just need to try harder again next time.}{HA: You just need to try harder next time.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.30,0:13:32.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can’t even keep the promise I made with Yuki-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:34.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.75,0:13:37.21,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.05,0:13:48.93,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And so, Akihime is really depressed...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.70,0:13:54.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Undoubtedly, losing the battle last night was disheartening. {HA: a shock? maybe dissapointing?} {For sure, losing the battle last night was disheartening. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.25,0:13:56.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t get it, do you? {HA: You don't get it, do you?}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.40,0:14:02.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Listen carefully. The power of a Stellar Spinear's spell... {HA: Listen carefully. The power of a Stellaspinia spell.}{Same namechange here. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.65,0:14:07.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The magic’s power reflects the power of the user’s heart. {HA: power? (of the user's heart)}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.40,0:14:10.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Their heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.90,0:14:15.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,If something good happens and her heart is happy, then her power increases. {HA: If something good happens, and her heart is happy, then power goes up/rises.} {HA: Could it be and she is happy?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.60,0:14:20.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,On the other hand, if something sad happens or depression sets in, their power begins to decrease.{Reversibly if sad things happened, or depression sits in the power goes down.}{HA: On the flip side, if sad things happen, or depression sets in, the power goes down./lowers.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.65,0:14:22.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Something sad?{Sad things?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.55,0:14:27.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun, is there anything you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.70,0:14:30.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Who knows…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.95,0:14:34.06,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,You don’t know, even though you guys are always together? {HA: You don't know? Even though you guys are always together?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.06,0:14:36.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,E-Even if you say that…{/Even if you say it like that…}{HA: E-Even if you say it like that..}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.95,0:14:43.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In these situations, I believe that girls will cheer up if they get attention from the person they like. {HA: Split?}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.65,0:14:55.20,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,He took me all the way back to the entrance ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.20,0:14:57.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was… very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.35,0:15:01.04,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even if... Akihime really likes me... {HA: Even... If Akihime really likes me...}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.04,0:15:05.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,As of right now, I can't do anything for her.{Me as of right now cannot do anything for her.}{HA: As of right now, I cannot do anything, for her.} {As of right now, I can't do anything for her.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.75,0:15:09.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’ll always be troublesome for Akihime. {\check}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.68,0:15:11.72,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can't say anything about what I heard yesterday. {\check}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.05,0:15:14.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And{...} even more so to smile. {\check}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.65,0:15:17.27,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:19.64,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Have some. {HA: Here! Have some.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.64,0:15:21.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I got the yakisoba bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.85,0:15:22.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.81,0:15:24.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Why? It’s your favorite.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.80,0:15:27.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I don’t have any appetite. {HA: I'm not hungry.}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.25,0:15:34.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Maybe Tsuwabuki-kun is in love or something. {HA: erm, needs rewording? } {It's fine. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.65,0:15:37.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,In love?! W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:45.13,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I'm right, am I not?{Bingo, isn’t it?/Correct, is it?}{I'm right, am I not?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:48.59,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?! Haru in love? {HA: Haru?}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.59,0:15:50.38,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Lies! It can't be!{Lies, it can’t be.} {HA: Lies! It can't be.} {Usoda? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.15,0:15:54.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, it's possible, yes.{No, It seems possible, yes.} {HA: I mean, it's possible, yeah!}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.50,0:15:56.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But... I'm not really sure...{But, I really don’t know so.}{HA: But... I'm not really sure...}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.52,0:15:59.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It may be that staying as friends is what she wants.{It might be that staying as a friends is wanted}{\check} {HA: She(?) may want to stay as friends...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.05,0:16:05.19,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That girl, what's she like?{That girl, how is she?}{HA: That girl, what's she like?}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.37,0:16:06.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,What she's like...{How you ask…}{HA: What she's...like...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.80,0:16:11.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She cries easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.54,0:16:15.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She's small and insecure.{A crybaby, looks small and insecure.}{HA: "A crybaby" sounds mean... and.. possible splitting? there's 6 seconds here!} {HA: She cries easily... she's small, and she's insecure. }
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.75,0:16:18.63,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, she always tries her best.{But always trying best at something.}{HA: But, she always tries her best.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.63,0:16:24.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She tries hard, and she's very kind-hearted.{Trys hard, and very kind-hearted/gentle girl.}{HA: She tries hard, and she's very kind-hearted.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.17,0:16:27.92,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I can believe that. There's no mistake about it.{That I think is no mistake about that.}{HA: I believe there is no mistake about that.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.15,0:16:29.46,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So it's something like this, right? {HA: It's like this?} {Original seems okay. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.46,0:16:34.51,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun is thinking, "I cannot do anything for that girl," or... {HA: Tsuwabuki is thinking, "I cannot do anything for her", or...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.51,0:16:36.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,"Even if I confess it would only cause trouble." {HA: "Even if I confess, it would only cause trouble.", or...}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:38.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Something like that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.87,0:16:43.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But you know, Haru...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.45,0:16:48.11,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Those things aren't important to girls.{The things important to girls aren’t things like that.}{HA: Things like those, aren't important to girls.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Keisuke-kun, did something happen with Nobuko?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.83,0:16:56.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,W-Well, this really isn't about Nobuko-san.{W-Well, this doesn’t really matter with Nobuko-san.}{HA: W-well, this isn't about Nobuko-san.}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.20,0:16:59.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, as he said...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The important thing is to be honest with your feelings, right?{The important thing would be the honest feeling wouldn’t it?} {HA: It's important to be honest, right? (?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:11.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,A confession!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.88,0:17:14.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Right! I should tag along and...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.34,0:17:16.14,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Let's just observe quietly.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.18,0:17:19.81,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,No, no. I'm worried about Haru confessing properly.{No, no, I’m worried if Haru will confess properly}{HA: No, no, I'm worried about Haru confessing properly.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:23.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’m telling you not to interfere. Got it? {HA: I'm telling you not to interfere. Got it?}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.70,0:17:25.56,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Y-Yes…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.60,0:17:33.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I have no confidence even though I'm running fast.{I have no confidence in running fast.}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.25,0:17:37.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But...  But...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.05,0:17:42.32,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Even so...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.11,0:17:45.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I... {\check} {HA: But still... I...}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.80,0:18:10.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Aki-
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:16.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}If I...  If I don’t say anything... {thought}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.72,0:18:20.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,But, what...? {\thought)}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.57,0:18:23.87,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun, what’s wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:25.66,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.30,0:18:30.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That is... I was thinking about that flower I was arranging.{That… The flower I was cleaning/arranging was on my mind.}{HA: That... The flower I was arranging was on my mind.}{That.. I was thinking about the flower that I was arranging. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.80,0:18:32.34,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Me too. {HA: Same here.}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.34,0:18:36.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't take care of this place a lot.{This place I couldn’t really take care of a lot.}{HA: I can't take care of this place alot (?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.65,0:18:41.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to do something for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.70,0:18:46.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’ll help.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.90,0:19:08.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Not good. It’s almost time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.79,0:19:14.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,T-Tsuwabuki-kun... Umm, come this way... {HA: Tsu-Tsuwabuki-kun, umm, come here...}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.90,0:19:19.76,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Could you please come with me?{I wish you would come with me.}{HA: I want you to come with me (?)}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.40,0:19:49.60,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Try standing here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.40,0:19:52.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime, what…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.45,0:20:14.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,This is…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.05,0:20:19.50,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,During the sunset... {HA: During sunset,}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:22.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For a short while... {HA: For a short while,}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.60,0:20:27.05,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It shines likes this.{It becomes like this./It shines like this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.27,0:20:31.65,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.17,0:20:35.85,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It’s very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.40,0:20:47.89,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.89,0:20:52.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Can we keep this as a secret, just between you and me?{Well… Can we keep this as a secret only between us?}{HA: U-Um... Can we keep this as a secret, just between you and me?}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.80,0:20:56.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Only us? Does Yaeno not know? {HA: Does Yaeno not know about this?} {Doesn't Yaeno know about this? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:20:57.82,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.{Yep/Yea.}{That's right. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.36,0:21:03.28,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I kept it a secret from everyone, even Nako.{/I kept it a even to Nako, and everyone else.}{HA: I kept it a secret from everyone, even Nako.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.20,0:21:08.90,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For me, when I’m depressed I come here and watch this. {When I'm depressed, I come here and watch this. - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.55,0:21:12.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,It cheers me up a little.{Just a little I cheer up.}{HA: It cheers me up a little.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.30,0:21:18.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Tsuwabuki-kun, you looked like you didn’t have any energy. {HA: Tsuwabuki-kun, you looked like you didn't have any energy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.96,0:21:24.88,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,So I thought that if you saw this, you might cheer up a bit. {HA: I figured that if you saw this, you might cheer up a bit.}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.05,0:21:29.35,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Akihime. {(thought)}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.03,0:21:33.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Even though you went through all that… {thought+check}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.40,0:21:38.44,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,For me... you...{About me} {thought} {ok, its getting really really corny…} {HA: For...me...}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.30,0:21:50.40,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Akihime.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.70,0:21:53.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I’m sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.85,0:21:56.15,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,The reason why I came here... {HA: The reason why I came,}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.58,0:22:00.96,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And how worried I was about the flowers was a lie.{About how I worried about the flowers was a lie.}{HA: And how I worried about the flowers was a lie.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.70,0:22:03.17,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.60,0:22:10.10,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I was actually looking for you... Akihime.{In truth, I was searching. For/About Akihime.}{HA: I was actually looking for you, Akihime.}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:13.97,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.19,0:22:17.03,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.90,0:22:24.75,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I… like you, Akihime.{HA: I... like you, Akihime.} {Comment: kokuhaku daisakusen~ - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.20,0:24:23.25,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Sumomo-chan’s father is a well-known author. {HA: i don't know what to change it too x.x'} {respected author? well-known? - megu}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.25,0:24:24.00,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,And her mother?{Her mother it?}{HA: And her mother?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.00,0:24:25.55,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,That is a mystery. {HA: That's a mystery./That we don't know.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.55,0:24:26.70,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,She's in another country right? {HA: She's in another country, right?}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.70,0:24:27.30,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I see. {\check} {HA: I see.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.30,0:24:29.07,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Rumor has it that she's very beautiful.{She was beautiful as the rumors say.}{HA: Rumor has it, she was beautiful.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.07,0:24:30.73,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Just like a goddess.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.73,0:24:32.80,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,I want a date with her.{I wan’t to date./I want a date with her.}{HA: I want to go out with her.}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.80,0:24:34.37,Nanatsuiro[Default],,0000,0000,0000,,Think of the age difference!{Think of your age!/Think of the age difference!}{HA: You're way too young!}
